        {
          "text": "Kosodi Isaia enabi abunore mama ejai eka baka Kesekia, korema ŋes atiar, “Anyoika nuabalasi ituŋa nul? Apote kai aponare mamakonj “Kotema Kesekia atiar, “Apote kakwap naelwana, Babulon.’ ",
