              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotema atiar, “Inyo bo aanyut kotogokon?” Koboŋok Kesekia ebe, “Aanyut iboro kere luejass togoka: emamei ibore koboroka luka akais nuipu yenimam eoŋ etodikinit kes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
